(7406744, 1166543, 25024, '<td valign="top">*Hello from Sid and the critique club*<br/> <br/>An uninspiring image that partially meets the challenge.<br/> <br/>Your interpretation of the challenge is presumably intended to reflect the ravages of weather wear and tear on the structure but I see this more as dereliction and decay rather than wear and tear which I would more readily associate with continued use as opposed to the abandonment of this scene. The lighting is very harsh with some extreme contrasts and blown out highlights, I think a stop of -EC would have worked well here to rescue those highlights, the shadows have enough latitude to enable it. I think your composition could have excluded the pole to the benefit of the overall result.<br/> <br/>Thank you for your submission, Sid</td>', '*Hello from Sid and the critique club* An uninspiring image that partially meets the challenge. Your interpretation of the challenge is presumably intended to reflect the ravages of weather wear and tear on the structure but I see this more as dereliction and decay rather than wear and tear which I would more readily associate with continued use as opposed to the abandonment of this scene. The lighting is very harsh with some extreme contrasts and blown out highlights, I think a stop of -EC would have worked well here to rescue those highlights, the shadows have enough latitude to enable it. I think your composition could have excluded the pole to the benefit of the overall result. Thank you for your submission, Sid', '2015-09-29 18:35:31.000000', NULL, 0),
